    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 2500000025000000
    functionCalls: []
  - text: Ah.$.$. $$In that case.$.$. $$Is it really ugly though? $$It's just a flower.
    displayText: Ah... In that case... Is it really ugly though? It's just a flower.
